Space Fantasy

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:16.120
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:18.330
Space Fantasy

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:22.200
I came all this way just to meet you
Anata ni ai ni kokomade kita no

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:28.670
